{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55223","headline":"题幽州石经山（在南） · 李存勖","name":"题幽州石经山（在南）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲弃五马谒真宗，来入山门问远公。\n云起乱峰朝古寺，鸟巢高处恋晴空。\n碧萝引蔓枝枝到，石溜穿渠院院通。\n佛境不离人境内，人心不与佛心同。\n（均见斯三七三卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李存勖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}